
>> shop := (Rječnik novi
	stavi: ['magazine'] na: ['books'],
	stavi: ['computer'] na: ['electronics'],
	stavi: ['lipstick'] na: ['cosmetics']
).
Izlaz piši: (shop ima: ['computer']), novi-red. 
Izlaz piši: (shop ima: ['sausage']), novi-red. 
Izlaz piši: (shop ima: ['computers']), novi-red. 
Izlaz piši: (shop ima: ['compute']), novi-red. 
Izlaz piši: (shop ima: ['2computer']), novi-red. 
